## ObjectType: Market Price

Synthetic sourced last-price quote assigned to a snapshot. Prior weekday quote dates preserve market-date meaning at weekend month ends.

### Semantic Provenance

| Key | Value |
|---|---|
| source_iri | https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/InstrumentPricing/MarketPrice |
| source_label | market price |
| source_definition | last reported price at which a security was sold |
| source_revision | 2d73435a4419b66b7c9f44cb9763e35fe8ac7890 |
| source_license | MIT |
| source_repository | https://github.com/edmcouncil/fibo |

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| price_id | Price Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | price_id |
| instrument_id | Instrument Id | string | Foreign key to financial_instruments; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | instrument_id |
| as_of_date | As Of Date | date | Business snapshot date, distinct from quote/fixing date and date of knowledge. | as_of_date |
| price_date | Price Date | date | Date of the underlying reported quote; previous weekday at weekend snapshot; age limit is three calendar days. | price_date |
| published_date | Published Date | date | Business publication/fixing date; actual data must have been published before consumption. | published_date |
| price | Price | decimal | Local-currency quote in the linked instrument basis; apply price_multiplier. | price |
| currency | Currency | string | Instrument denomination; must agree across trade, instruction, opening and position. | currency |
| approval | Approval | string | Explicit controlled state/reason; absence never implies completion or acceptance. Allowed values: approved, unapproved. | approval |
| pricing_source | Pricing Source | string | Declared synthetic demo_pricing provider, not a live exchange or approved production feed. Allowed values: demo_pricing. | pricing_source |
| view_kind | View Kind | string | actual is a synthetic observed fact; planned is an explicit forecast known at the observation date, never actual future completion. Allowed values: actual, planned. | view_kind |
| known_date | Known Date | date | Date this fact/assumption was available; actual facts cannot use future knowledge, planned assumptions are known by 2027-02-28. | known_date |

